From e6ebd4f835009c134c027335a8cca768802f4ab2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scroll Ash Lab <scrollash.lab@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:59:51 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] tifxyz: record optional voxel_size_um and detect scale/frame
 ambiguity

meta.json "scale" is grid cells per voxel of that mesh's own scan. Segments
often ship several meshes that declare the same scale while voxel sizes differ
by up to ~40x (#1522). Add optional voxel_size_um, document the trap, helpers
to annotate from the conventional -<float>um directory token, and a metadata-
only ambiguity check across a segment mesh/ tree.
